<title>USA: Burlington, Iowa, won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Burlington, Iowa, won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $4.500 million of Burlington, Iowa., general obligation corporate purpose bonds, with a trueinterest cost of 4.847 percent.</p>
</text>
